.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store

# Claude Code tooling state (session / worktree scratch — never tracked)
.claude/*
# 项目级 skill 要随仓库走（团队共享）；注意父目录若被整个排除，负号规则是无效的，
